Thanks for applying to Acme Electric! This note is to let you know that your application for our Apprentice Electrician opening (Anaheim yard) made it to our hiring team.

Here's how our process works:
1. Our office reviews applications every Friday.
2. Candidates we'd like to meet get a call from our office manager to set up a 20-minute phone conversation.
3. Phone conversations are followed by an in-person meeting at the yard with one of our foremen.

We try to respond to everyone within two weeks. If you haven't heard from us by then, feel free to reply to this email.

